Subject: [PATCH 4b] NR RRC: share and unit-test SNPN SIB1 selector

Depends on:
  0003c-snpn-npn-codec-test.patch
  0004-nr-ue-snpn-selection.patch

Upstream anchor:
  openairinterface/openairinterface5g
  f8f769592a7030be88ede4bb5ca66fa1ca6a80e0

This moves the ASN.1-specific PLMN+NID lookup into asn1_msg.c, which is
already part of nr_rrc and therefore directly testable by test_asn1_msg.

Gate:
  PASS_V5G_SNPN_SELECT_UNIT

